# Machine settings and secrets: which solver this machine uses, and the Gurobi
# licence that makes it legal. The example beside it IS committed, and carries
# no licence - see Dashboard/backend/.env.example. (The licence written from .env
# lands in Dashboard/backend/cache/gurobi/, already ignored above.)
**/.env
**/.env.local
!**/.env.example
**/gurobi.lic
